      (26,34,"`ModelResult`: the building, the cleaned points (for the PLY connector), two flags copied from the snapshot so the PLY file only writes hits and intensity columns when they were really measured, and the report."),
      (36,38,"Declares `run_model`. It is pure: no files, no network, so live mode, offline mode and tests run exactly the same code. The building comes back in the original map frame, so it lies on top of the raw cloud in the browser without any transform."),
